<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards" data-stagger><a class="card rv" href="/claim-planning-tools/award-break-even-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-badge">±$</span></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k">Calculator</span><h2 class="card-h">Award Break-Even Calculator</h2><p>Size the disputed amount, test where an award might land and see your break-even point after fees.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-planning-tools/two-check-payout-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kitchen.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kitchen-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kitchen.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-badge">ACV</span></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k">Calculator</span><h2 class="card-h">Two-Check Payout Calculator</h2><p>List damaged items with age and life to estimate the first ACV check and the depreciation held back.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-planning-tools/roof-area-ice-barrier-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-closeup2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-closeup2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-closeup2.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-badge">▲</span></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k">Calculator</span><h2 class="card-h">Roof Area &amp; Ice-Barrier Calculator</h2><p>Turn a footprint into true roof squares, bundles and eave ice-barrier footage for a cold-climate roof.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-planning-tools/hail-deductible-dollar-converter/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-ground.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-ground-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-ground.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-badge">%</span></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k">Calculator</span><h2 class="card-h">Hail Deductible Dollar Converter</h2><p>Convert a percentage wind/hail deductible into dollars and see what a storm claim would actually pay.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-planning-tools/policy-clock-freeze-up-planner/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-badge">◷</span></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k">Planner</span><h2 class="card-h">Policy Clock &amp; Freeze-Up Planner</h2><p>Map notice, proof-of-loss, holdback and suit dates from your date of loss, then export an .ics file.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-planning-tools/claim-file-strength-test/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/handshake.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/handshake-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/handshake.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-badge">✓</span></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k">Checklist</span><h2 class="card-h">Claim File Strength Test</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before you invoke appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/claim-planning-tools/snow-ice-roof-weight-estimator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="783" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-badge">❄</span></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k">Estimator</span><h2 class="card-h">Snow &amp; Ice Roof Weight Estimator</h2><p>Estimate pounds per square foot from snow depth, snow type and ice — and compare it with a design load.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap two top"><div class="rv"><p class="label"><span>→</span>Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol class="steps-list"><li>Start with the <a href="/claim-planning-tools/policy-clock-freeze-up-planner/">policy clock &amp; freeze-up planner</a> so nothing lapses.</li><li>Check roof math with the <a href="/claim-planning-tools/roof-area-ice-barrier-calculator/">roof area &amp; ice-barrier calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’re actually owed with the <a href="/claim-planning-tools/hail-deductible-dollar-converter/">deductible</a> and <a href="/claim-planning-tools/two-check-payout-calculator/">payout</a> calculators.</li><li>Test the dispute with the <a href="/claim-planning-tools/award-break-even-calculator/">break-even calculator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/claim-planning-tools/claim-file-strength-test/">file strength test</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through first</h2><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="box-tel" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg>+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/request-an-appraisal/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
